                  "content": "**Measurement period:** Day = sunrise to sunset; night = sunset to sunrise.\n**Current tariff:** {{ states('sensor.red_energy_current_tariff') }}\n**Red Energy rates (bill issued 10 Jun 2026):** Peak 4-9 pm, Shoulder 9 pm-11 am, Off Peak 11 am-4 pm. All three usage bands are currently **$0.3203/kWh**. Solar feed-in is **$0.05/kWh** and daily supply is **$1.293/day**.\nTonight is a partial night because tracking started after sunset. The first complete day will be stored after the next sunset; the first complete night after the following sunrise. Rolling history becomes meaningful after several completed periods."
