            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Air Conditioner Estimates",
              "heading_style": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "**Method:** When one AC starts while every other AC is off, HA records the whole-house load, waits **7 minutes**, and measures the increase. Later valid samples are smoothed to reduce normal household-load noise.\n\n| Air conditioner | Directional estimate |\n|---|---:|\n| Kitchen AC | {% set v = states('input_number.kitchen_ac_estimated_power') | float(0) %}{% if v > 0 %}**{{ v | round(1) }} kW**{% else %}Waiting for an isolated start{% endif %} |\n| Lounge Room AC | {% set v = states('input_number.lounge_room_ac_estimated_power') | float(0) %}{% if v > 0 %}**{{ v | round(1) }} kW**{% else %}Waiting for an isolated start{% endif %} |\n| Main Bedroom AC | {% set v = states('input_number.main_bedroom_ac_estimated_power') | float(0) %}{% if v > 0 %}**{{ v | round(1) }} kW**{% else %}Waiting for an isolated start{% endif %} |\n| Study AC | {% set v = states('input_number.study_ac_estimated_power') | float(0) %}{% if v > 0 %}**{{ v | round(1) }} kW**{% else %}Waiting for an isolated start{% endif %} |\n| Bed2 AC | {% set v = states('input_number.bed2_ac_estimated_power') | float(0) %}{% if v > 0 %}**{{ v | round(1) }} kW**{% else %}Waiting for an isolated start{% endif %} |\n\n*These are directional estimates, not meter-grade readings. Starts are ignored when another AC is already running.*"
            }
          ]
